     These functions return the symbolic name of a numeric DWARF constant.

     Argument _v_a_l specifies the numeric value whose symbolic name is desired.

     Argument _s_t_r should point to a location which will hold the returned NUL-
     terminated string containing the symbolic name of the specified value.

